WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.001
Come with me...

00:00:01.335 --> 00:00:02.920
and let's build the future...

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:04.922
together.

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.425
What do you care about?

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:10.177
When were you happiest?

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.597
Make a business out of that feeling.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:17.017
What do you think
when I say, "Workspace?"

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:18.894
Cubicles...

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.521
ugly furniture...

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:22.481
bad fluorescent lighting...

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:24.316
death.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.401
Exactly.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:30.364
The future of work looks different.

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:32.282
We're selling an experience.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.576
We.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:35.994
We need a name.

00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:36.954
"We."

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.747
-"WeLive."
-"WeDream."

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.915
"WeWork."

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:46.505
Who wins in a fight?

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:47.965
The smart guy?

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:50.008
Or the crazy guy?

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:51.593
Are you crazy enough?

00:00:51.677 --> 00:00:53.804
I may be.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.225
Is Adam for real?

00:00:58.308 --> 00:00:59.893
I wouldn't be with him if he wasn't.

00:00:59.977 --> 00:01:01.520
The wife, she works there.

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:03.313
She helps him manifest things.

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:06.692
We are on track
to lose 400 million this year.

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:07.985
I built this.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.278
Enough, Adam!

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:10.821
Well, I feel trapped.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.155
You have to make them see.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:13.490
See what?

00:01:13.574 --> 00:01:14.783
You're a supernova.

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:18.495
You're afraid that he outshines you...

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:19.496
Can I get a single of Adam?

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:20.205
...because he does.

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:24.501
Are you a maverick or a muse?

00:01:24.668 --> 00:01:25.419
A muse.

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:26.378
Tell me about your goals.

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:28.922
I wanna be in Vanity Fair.

00:01:29.006 --> 00:01:30.591
Vanity Fair is not for muses.

00:01:32.301 --> 00:01:34.094
Then I wanna change my answer.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:38.974
I wanted you to meet
the legendary Adam Neumann

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:41.852
-and his wife--
-Chief Branding Officer.

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:44.271
We lease office space.

00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:46.190
Then we act like
we're changing the world.

00:01:46.273 --> 00:01:47.274
They're turning on you.

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:48.525
You're going to sink the ship.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.820
That's 1.9 billion in losses.

00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:53.447
Nothing is more important...

00:01:53.739 --> 00:01:54.656
than us.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:57.242
I have a responsibility to think bigger.

00:01:57.534 --> 00:01:59.786
I'm a golden goose laying golden eggs.

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:01.413
You couldn't do this without me.

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:03.415
We're going to war!

00:02:05.542 --> 00:02:09.213
We do this together,
we can change everything.

